  dialogueLine:
  - "\u201CWhat even is this plant? It\u2019s covered in thorns\u2026\""
  - "\"Let\u2019s try burning it with magic\u2026\""
  - "\"Huh. That didn\u2019t work.\""
  - "\"Weird\u2026 now that I take a closer look, it gives off the same feeling as
    a sealing spell.\""
  - "\"If it\u2019s a seal, then there must be a way to undo it.\""
  - "\"I\u2019ve been sensing a strange magical presence to the northwest since earlier\u2026\""
  - "\"I should go check it out.\u201D"
